      "text": "The function \\( f \\) has derivatives of all orders, and its values at \\( x = 1 \\) are \\( f(1) = 3 \\), \\( f'(1) = 2 \\), \\( f''(1) = -4 \\), \\( f'''(1) = 12 \\). Let \\( P \\) be the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 1 \\). Find the value of \\( P\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right) \\)."
